      <ul><li><a href="https://www.crictracker.com/cricket-news/after-2018-incident-steve-smith-was-more-relaxed-as-a-player-says-aaron-finch-4512/" rel="noopener">Crictracker</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
