       <div class="tags"><span>#tech</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Amazon announced a series of new smart home devices, highlighted by the updated Echo Show 16. This latest model features a 16-inch display housed in an anodized aluminum frame that is nearly 40 percent thinner than its predecessor.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-28/amazon-unveils-new-echo-lineup-featuring-enhanced-echo-show-.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The new Echo Show 16 offers a Nanomatte display option designed to reduce glare and includes an upgraded audio system with micro woofers and two tweeters for improved clarity. These announcements, revealed on Wednesday, focus primarily on expanding the Echo speaker line and introducing various smart home gadgets.</p>
